WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.960
Liu Bei heard there was a master of great talent in Nanyang, and he felt deep admiration.

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:08.102
He decided to go in person and invite this master to come out and help him.

00:00:08.452 --> 00:00:12.220
He brought Guan Yu and Zhang Fei along, prepared gifts, and set out.

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:15.858
He went in person to visit, but unfortunately the master was not at home.

00:00:16.208 --> 00:00:19.520
Liu Bei left a message and slowly left the mountain village with regret.

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:23.158
The second time he came braving heavy snow, but the master was still not at home.

00:00:23.508 --> 00:00:27.060
His companions felt a little discouraged, but Liu Bei was not angry at all.

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:31.298
Liu Bei patted his companions' shoulders and said they would come again next time.

00:00:31.648 --> 00:00:36.568
The third time, Liu Bei waited patiently, and at last he met Zhuge Liang.

00:00:36.918 --> 00:00:40.878
Zhuge Liang straightened his clothes and came out himself to welcome Liu Bei inside.

00:00:41.228 --> 00:00:45.548
The two talked very happily, and Zhuge Liang was moved by Liu Bei's sincerity.

00:00:45.898 --> 00:00:48.826
As they drank tea, they discussed the great affairs of the land together.

00:00:49.176 --> 00:00:52.224
Zhuge Liang brought out a map and carefully explained his ideas.

00:00:52.574 --> 00:00:56.006
Zhuge Liang agreed to leave his retreat and help; Liu Bei felt like a fish back in water.

00:00:56.356 --> 00:00:59.428
From then on, Liu Bei's cause had the finest strategist to help it.

